msgctxt "199269\tMORE_EXPLANATION1"
msgid ""
"Kiryu\n"
"\n"
"I decided to write you this letter when I heard\n"
"you had returned to Kamurocho. I am currently\n"
"running a dojo at the Dragon Palace, but I\n"
"recently had to leave on a trip.\n"
"\n"
"While I was away, I understand some trouble-makers\n"
"appeared at the Dragon Palace, and that you\n"
"fought them off. I wanted to thank you for that."
msgstr ""

